  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Use fgetc/fputc instead of getc/putc by @anzz1 in https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/pull/50\r\n* Update docs to reflect PR 50 by @ckormanyos in https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/pull/51\r\n* Test coverage by @ckormanyos in https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/pull/54\r\n* Update docs and add a new test by @ckormanyos in https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/pull/56\r\n* Try to increase further the code coverage by @ckormanyos in https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/pull/57\r\n* Add more tests and update docs by @ckormanyos in https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/pull/58\r\n* Update version and docs and add more tests by @ckormanyos in https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/pull/59\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @anzz1 made their first contribution in https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/pull/50\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ckormanyos/xxd/compare/v1.1...v1.2",
